program(
    "phantoms", 12,
    "the phantoms as FreeType holds them: cur rounded (0, 448, 576, -128), org unrounded (450, 600, -150); pp2 moved to 576 makes the advance 576 (pp1 is never moved, so the reported x is cur.x itself)",
    "SVTCA[x] PUSHB 14 GC[0] PUSHB 12 SWAP SCFS PUSHB 15 GC[0] PUSHB 13 SWAP SCFS PUSHB 15 GC[1] PUSHB 9 SWAP SCFS "
    "SVTCA[y] PUSHB 16 GC[0] PUSHB 10 SWAP SCFS PUSHB 17 GC[0] PUSHB 11 SWAP SCFS PUSHB 16 GC[1] PUSHB 8 SWAP SCFS "
    "PUSHB 17 GC[1] PUSHB 7 SWAP SCFS SVTCA[x] PUSHB 15 128 SHPIX",
)

